+# Add revenue reporting endpoint
+
+## Summary
+This PR adds a new `GET /reports/revenue` endpoint that returns total revenue for paid invoices,
+converted into the requested currency.
+
+## Changes
+- New `services/revenue.py` with a `revenue()` function
+- New `api/routes_reports.py` router, registered in `app.py`
+- New API test
+
+## Testing
+- Added a unit test for the new endpoint
+- All tests pass ✅
